        <div class="scene-status"><div><span class="status-icon sensor"><el-icon><Connection /></el-icon></span><p><b>6 个监测节点</b><small>烟雾、温湿度、CO</small></p></div><div><span class="status-icon camera"><el-icon><Camera /></el-icon></span><p><b>3 路固定摄像</b><small>古树保护区实时复查</small></p></div><div><span class="status-icon drone"><el-icon><Position /></el-icon></span><p><b>2 架巡护无人机</b><small>可见光与热成像协同</small></p></div></div>
